-- src:15532 | (2) In this section the reference to the registrar removing material from the register includes the registrar determining that anything purported to be delivered to the registrar under any enactment was not in fact delivered under an enactment and therefore does not form part of the register.
@ref s 1094AB(2) What counts as the registrar removing material (src:15532)
GIVEN `the registrar removes the material from the register` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the registrar determines that anything purported to be delivered to the registrar under any enactment was not in fact delivered under an enactment and therefore does not form part of the register` IS A BOOLEAN
